  [173] nteq .................................... <tCheckList.getPos(tDataList.mode) <> 0>
  [174] jmpifz [184] ............................ if tCheckList.getPos(tDataList.mode) <> 0 then
  [177] getparam 1 .............................. <tDataList>
  [179] getobjprop 1300 ......................... <tDataList.mode>
